<title>UK: KfW unit sets C$100 million six-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>KfW unit sets C$100 million six-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Toronto-Dominion.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KFW INTERNATIONAL FINANCE</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  KREDITANSTALT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT	C$100 MLN   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    30.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.78    PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    99.18     SPREAD	+27 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.275     SELL CONC  1.60	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.00 PCT CANADA BOND DUE SEP.01 -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
